{"schema":1,"revision":87546237,"page":{"pageid":7553420,"title":"棺材船","displayTitle":"棺材船","variant":"zh-tw"},"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant-TW\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Famine_national_monument_at_Murrisk_-_geograph.org.uk_-_965072.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Famine_national_monument_at_Murrisk_-_geograph.org.uk_-_965072.jpg/250px-Famine_national_monument_at_Murrisk_-_geograph.org.uk_-_965072.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"167\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Famine_national_monument_at_Murrisk_-_geograph.org.uk_-_965072.jpg/500px-Famine_national_monument_at_Murrisk_-_geograph.org.uk_-_965072.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"640\" data-file-height=\"427\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>棺材船</b>（Coffin ship）是指19世紀中期橫跨<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E8%A5%BF%E6%B4%8B\" title=\"大西洋\">大西洋</a>，載運愛爾蘭饑荒移民和蘇格蘭高地<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%AB%98%E5%9C%B0%E6%B8%85%E6%B4%97\" title=\"高地清洗\">被驅逐的蓋爾人</a>移民赴北美的船隻。運載逃難移民的「棺材船」由於船票便宜，船主儘量超載乘客，而且儘量壓縮對乘客的飲食供應，船艙擁擠，且又無法獲得充足的食物和淡水，乘客們極易染病，因此導致了許多人在橫跨大西洋的旅途中死亡，旅客的死亡率高達30%<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。在航行過程中，不斷有屍體被拋入大海，引得<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%B2%A8%E9%B1%BC\" title=\"鯊魚\">鯊魚</a>尾隨跟蹤，並導致了1847年<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8A%A0%E6%8B%BF%E5%A4%A7\" title=\"加拿大\">加拿大</a>檢疫站<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%91%E7%96%B9%E5%82%B7%E5%AF%92\" title=\"斑疹傷寒\">斑疹傷寒</a>的大流行<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>1997年為紀念<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%88%B1%E5%B0%94%E5%85%B0%E5%A4%A7%E9%A5%A5%E8%8D%92\" title=\"愛爾蘭大饑荒\">愛爾蘭大饑荒</a>150周年，雕刻藝術家<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"约翰·贝汉\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"John Behan (sculptor)\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%BA%A6%E7%BF%B0%C2%B7%E8%B4%9D%E6%B1%89&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"約翰·貝漢（頁面不存在）\">約翰·貝漢</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Behan_(sculptor)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:John Behan (sculptor)\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">John Behan (sculptor)</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>在<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A2%85%E5%A5%A7%E9%83%A1\" title=\"梅奧郡\">梅奧郡</a><span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"穆里斯克\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Murrisk\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%A9%86%E9%87%8C%E6%96%AF%E5%85%8B&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"穆里斯克（頁面不存在）\">穆里斯克</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Murrisk\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Murrisk\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Murrisk</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>的<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%88%B1%E5%B0%94%E5%85%B0%E5%A4%A7%E9%A5%A5%E8%8D%92\" title=\"愛爾蘭大饑荒\">愛爾蘭大饑荒</a>紀念碑旁，創作了青銅雕塑「棺材船」（右上圖），愛爾蘭總統<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%91%AA%E9%BA%97%C2%B7%E7%BE%85%E8%B3%93%E9%81%9C\" title=\"瑪麗·羅賓遜\">瑪麗·羅賓遜</a>特意為「棺材船」青銅雕塑的落成揭幕。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"注释\"><span id=\".E6.B3.A8.E9.87.8A\"></span>注釋</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%A3%BA%E6%9D%90%E8%88%B9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：注釋\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95310437\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-alpha{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-roman{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-alpha{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-greek{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-roman{list-style-type:lower-roman}</style><div class=\"reflist\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Early Emigrant Letter Stories\". eligrantletters.com</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Gallagher, The Reverend John A. (1936). \"The Fever Fleet - The Irish Emigration of 1847 and Its Canadian Consequences\". CCHA Report, University of Manitoba Website. Retrieved 23 March 2008</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐api‐ext.codfw.main‐69b9bf689b‐lg6lp\nCached time: 20261028130809\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.080 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.247 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 98/1000000\nRevision size: 1516/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 2100/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 54/20971